Selenium Identify Webelement using these methods

1.findElement()
------------------
- findElement() identify sigle webelement
- findElement() return single WebElement interface object
- findElement() fail to identify element then it throws exception NoSuchElementException

2.findElements()
----------------------
- findElements() identify multiple similar type of elements
- findElements() return List<WebElement>
- If element not found then findElements() never throws any exception

